<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 26.18 to officially close at 7357.23.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.01 to 439.66.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.10.</p>
<p>Advancers outpaced decliners 1310 to 1150.</p>
<p>Volume was 487,183,610 compared with 435,929,740 Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
